[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/pulls/965","id":4247946437,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSeuyxc79MoTF","html_url":"https://github.com/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/pull/965","diff_url":"https://github.com/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/pull/965.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/pull/965.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/issues/965","number":965,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: add jake, awesome and deedy resume templates from the latex classics","user":{"login":"saeedkolivand","id":51081940,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDgxOTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51081940?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand","html_url":"https://github.com/saeedkolivand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saeedkolivand/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nPhase 8 (résumé-template half) of the pipeline programme: three templates ported from the canonical LaTeX classics into Typst, taking the set 13 → 16.\n\n- **jake** (ATS tier) — the tech-standard minimal, routed through the parametric `single_column.typ` with a centred 24pt name\n- **awesome** (design tier) — thin accent header band (Awesome-CV lineage), bespoke `.typ`, full ATS-mode degradation (band + section markers drop)\n- **deedy** (design tier) — modern single-column (Deedy lineage), bespoke `.typ`, accent surname + wider section rhythm via a new `section_above_extra` registry knob\n\nPlus: golden/validator matrix coverage for all 16 (validator matrices now derive from `canonical_template_ids()` so a template can't skip coverage), regenerated preview assets + showcase banner, `TemplateId` now imported from the wire contract everywhere (drift becomes a `tsc` error), a third honest ATS-hint variant for decorative-only templates (en+de), and `docs/EXPORT_TEMPLATES.md` synced (twelve → sixteen, including the previously-missing cologne-navy row).\n\n## Internal review (pre-PR gates)\n\n3-pass `pr-reviewer` ensemble (opus + 2× sonnet) — 9 findings fixed across two domain authors, highlights:\n- jake's `name_centered` was a render no-op (`align(center)` inside an auto-width block) — caught by measuring glyph coordinates in the committed previews; fixed with render-measured centring tests + a left-aligned control, other 14 templates verified byte-identical by SVG hash\n- Awesome's DOCX band was run-level crimson shading with hardcoded white text (invisible wherever `w:shd` isn't honoured) and ignored `ats_mode` — now paragraph-level pale-tint shading with dark ink per the Banded-letter precedent, gated on ATS mode like the PDF\n- a suspected band overflow was confirmed *worse* than predicted: long contact lines rendered off the sheet entirely; the header now wraps inside the printable width with a title-aware band height, pinned by render measurements\n- the ATS toggle falsely told awesome/deedy users it \"removes the photo\" — a third hint key now covers decorative-only design templates in both call sites\n\nSteward close included (EXPORT_TEMPLATES.md + knowledge-base sync, lessons log, graphify).\n\n## Gates\n\n`cargo fmt` · `clippy --all-targets --all-features --locked -D warnings` · `cargo test --all-features` (3652 lib incl. golden + validator matrices, 18 architecture) · `pnpm typecheck` · `pnpm lint:strict` · `pnpm gen:ipc:check` · desktop vitest (3112) + shared (261) + translations — all green.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added Jake, Awesome, and Deedy resume templates, bringing the catalog to 16 templates.\n  * Added support for the new templates in resume previews, PDF, and DOCX exports.\n  * Added template-specific styling, including Awesome’s decorative header band and Deedy’s section spacing.\n  * Improved centered header alignment across supported templates.\n* **Improvements**\n  * ATS mode now provides tailored guidance and removes decorative styling where appropriate.\n  * Updated English and German translations for decorative ATS guidance.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated template catalog, ATS behavior, and preview documentation.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-08-10T20:13:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T21:31:00Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3430900139d429221201d9c1fc859d0c111bf016","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10964600421,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSeuyxc8AAAACjYqGZQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"0075ca","default":true,"description":"Documentation and markdown"},{"id":11212541200,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSeuyxc8AAAACnFHNEA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/labels/app/desktop","name":"app/desktop","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Changes to apps/desktop"},{"id":11212541282,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSeuyxc8AAAACnFHNYg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saeedkolivand/ai-job-hunter-app/labels/pkg/shared","name":"pkg/shared","color":"1abc9c","default":false,"description":"Changes to packag